      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: 'The voice from the vent answers, "Justice is paperwork."


          What''s
          it to you? Says the bug, says the voice. You aren''t sure anymore.


          You
          think. You aren''t sure. Is justice one thing?'
        type: 0
        typeString: 
